OL,3,GNEWSAInside the Victorian tunnels
OL,4,Abehind Merseyrail closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeneath the streets of Liverpool,
OL,7,Fengineers are drilling into Victorian
OL,8,Frailway tunnels in a #3.5m effort to
OL,9,Fstop water disrupting Merseyrail
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FThe work, which has closed part of the
OL,13,FNorthern Line for almost four weeks, is
OL,14,Fdesigned to prevent water damaging the
OL,15,Fnetwork's electrified rail and causing
OL,16,Ffuture faults.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
