OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAInside the Victorian tunnels
OL,4,Abehind Merseyrail closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FInside St James Tunnel, south of
OL,7,FLiverpool Central, engineers are
OL,8,Fdrilling into the curved brick roof
OL,9,Fbefore injecting resin into the
OL,10,Fstructure to create a waterproof
OL,11,Fbarrier.
OL,13,FThe aim is to stop water seeping
OL,14,Fthrough the Victorian brickwork and
OL,15,Fdripping on to the railway below.
